{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_34366","headline":"奉酬袭美病中见寄 · 陆龟蒙","name":"奉酬袭美病中见寄","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"逢花逢月便相招，忽卧云航隔野桥。\n春恨与谁同酩酊，玄言何处问逍遥？\n题诗石上空回笔，拾蕙汀边独倚桡。\n早晚却还岩下电，共寻芳径结烟条。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"陆龟蒙","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_34366.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_34366","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"杂言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}